        "pitch": "Imagine San Francisco, but replace the tech bros with impeccably dressed, Persian and Siamese lawyers. Our protagonist, Winston, is a relentlessly cheerful corgi with a law degree and an unshakeable belief in justice. He\u2019s arrived in the city, full of optimism, only to find himself facing overwhelming competition: a cutthroat legal community dominated by cats with centuries of experience manipulating the system. The visuals will be a vibrant clash of San Francisco\u2019s iconic locations \u2013 Lombard Street, the Ferry Building \u2013 juxtaposed with the absurdity of a corgi trying to navigate a world built for graceful felines. The soundtrack will bounce between upbeat, jazzy tunes and moments of dramatic tension, mirroring Winston\u2019s fluctuating confidence.  We\u2019ll see him fumble through courtroom presentations, outsmarted by sly feline tactics, and continually knocked down, but always getting back up with a wagging tail and a determined bark. This isn\u2019t just about a corgi trying to be a lawyer; it\u2019s about perseverance, finding your place in a world that isn\u2019t designed for you, and the surprising power of unwavering optimism \u2013 even if you\u2019re a short-legged, fluffy underdog.",
